--- a/docs/integration.md
+++ b/docs/integration.md
@@ -35,6 +35,12 @@
 7. ssh into the comma device with a running mapd instance and run
    `./selfdrive/mapd i` to download maps and configure mapd.
 
+### msgq reader slots
+mapd opens every queue with `MSGQ_MAX_READERS` reader slots (25, `settings/const.go`), the `NUM_READERS` of openpilot's
+`msgq/msgq.h` since commaai/msgq d44b74a. The queue header layout depends on it: with a different number on each side the
+header is 240 bytes off, openpilot never reads `mapdOut`, and mapd reads its inputs from the wrong place. For an openpilot
+whose msgq still has 15 slots, start mapd with the environment variable `MSGQ_MAX_READERS=15`.
+
 ## Advanced
 mapd offers a lot more data and options to allow for customization of behavior
 outside of the basic example above as well as outputs for use in the openpilot
